    "path": "architecture/adr/0030-grandfather-direct-access-from-quote_ser.md",
    "status": "accepted",
    "status_raw": "Accepted",
    "text": "# Grandfather direct access from quote_service during the layer migration\n\n* Status: Accepted\n* Date: 2025-08-18\n\n## Context and Problem Statement\n\nRule R004 forbids this access, but the data-access layer does not yet support streaming reads, and the proper layer will not be ready for some time.\n\n## Decision Outcome\n\nUntil the layer migration completes, the quote service (`quote_service`) may continue to access the database connection module (`connection`) directly. Dependencies of this kind introduced on or before 2025-09-13 are grandfathered. Any such dependency introduced after 2025-09-13 is NOT covered by this decision and must be treated as a violation of R004.\n\n### Consequences\n\nGrandfathered dependencies must be removed when the migration finishes.\n",
    "title": "Grandfather direct access from quote_service during the layer migration"
   }
  ],
